+From aaaf43c5b096d08470db36adb4a2786c8f0f4581 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Author <author@example.com>
+Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:44:50 +0300
+Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(awg): add packet counter obfuscation tag
+
+---
